+The React runtime evaluates recognised SurveyJS-dialect strings (`{age} >= 18`
+or `age >= 18`, `and`/`or`/`not`, `in [...]`, `empty`/`notempty`, `contains`)
+client-side at every gate level. A string it cannot parse is treated as always
